  ('terms', 'Terms & conditions', '1 July 2026', 'By placing an order with Ibibondo, you’re agreeing to pay the listed price plus the delivery fee shown at checkout for your zone. Prices are in Rwandan francs and can change without notice, but never after an order is confirmed.

